<h2>Build the system, then let it run</h2>

<p>Lead generation is not a one-time project. It is infrastructure. You build the landing page, set up the form, wire the follow-up sequence, optimise your Google profile, launch a referral system, and then you let it run. Each piece compounds on the others. Over time, the system generates leads without requiring your constant attention.</p>

<p>The businesses that grow predictably are not necessarily the ones with the biggest budgets. They are the ones with the best systems. Start with one channel, get it working, and then add the next.</p>

